  "description": "Demolition of the existing ground floor rear extension and construction of a part single, part two storey rear extension, including the ground floor rear extension permitted under application 24/0157/NMA. Reconfiguration of the front elevation, incorporating Georgian architectural characteristics, including: removal of the existing front gable bay, construction of a single storey front extension up to the existing porch, construction of a 485mm two storey side extension, changes to fenestration pattern, integration of brick to the main house elevation, demolition of existing flat roof to side extension, and erection of new tiled crown roof. Reconfiguration of front garden area, including demolition of existing front garden walls to habilitate original driveway access, erection of a new bin enclosure, erection of front garden wall with piers to match main house, and other front landscaping works",
